  "summary_md": "**EstoEsMarte ([@Esto_es_Marte](https://x.com/Esto_es_Marte/status/2115850109632012499))** presents **Forkfield**, an MIT ComfyUI app where every video is forkable: drop any clip, open-weight models read the effect, add your photo and regenerate; follow-ups add the code and an update that it now forks any video ([demo video](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qAVeIeFBYFM&feature=youtu.be), [app](https://forkfield.estoesmarte.workers.dev), [marciano71/forkfield](https://github.com/marciano71/forkfield)).",
